  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 402.04 Auxiliary tank",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 402.04 “Auxiliary tank” means a day tank installed in the supply piping between a heating oil burning device and the UST that supplies it, is an integral component of the piping system, and is a UL 443 tank not exceeding 60 gallons in capacity.\n\nSource. #12643, eff 10-10-18 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Or 400)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-or400.html"
